00:08:16.240 --> 00:08:28.720
You'll hear how creators still depend heavily on brand sponsorships and why agencies are pushing them toward businesses that can survive changing platforms and algorithms.

98
00:08:31.520 --> 00:08:35.840
Um those deals, they would have, of course, been commissioning brand deals.

