00:08:35.840 --> 00:08:46.720
And if you ask, you know, a big creator, I think you had Amelia de Moldenberg on your show, and you asked her this question, and she noted that still the majority of her revenues come from brand sponsorships.

100
00:08:46.880 --> 00:08:56.320
And so to the extent that a digital talent has had an agent for the last 10 years, we can be sure that the lowest hanging fruit for an agent would be commissioning those brand deals.

