111
00:10:18.120 --> 00:10:29.960
And so I think what we're broadly seeing is uh an effective um situation where the agents are becoming more like um equity partners.

112
00:10:29.960 --> 00:10:40.520
And if we think about the traditional, we'll talk about this, I'm sure, the traditional notion of a packaging fee and what that used to constitute in terms of a business for a Talonate.

